---
// Container cgroup working_set_bytes vs Go runtime heap layers and off-heap memory.
const W = 900;
const H = 378;
---
<figure class="gp17b">
  <div class="gp17b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Nested memory boundaries inside a Kubernetes container: container_memory_working_set_bytes wraps both Go heap memory and off-heap segments like goroutine stacks, Cgo or mmap buffers, and OS file cache. Inside Go heap, HeapSys covers virtual spans, HeapInuse covers active 8 KiB spans, and HeapAlloc counts live reachable objects.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Container working set vs Go runtime heap: what OOMKill sees vs what MemStats sees</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Working set của container và Go heap: thứ Kubernetes giết vs thứ MemStats đếm</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Outer container cgroup boundary */}
    <rect x="20" y="42" width="860" height="316" rx="10" class="outer" />
    <text x="36" y="66" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>container_memory_working_set_bytes (Kubernetes OOMKill limit · e.g. 512 MiB)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>container_memory_working_set_bytes (ngưỡng Kubernetes OOMKill · VD 512 MiB)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* GOMEMLIMIT inner dashed ceiling */}
    <line x1="36" x2="864" y1="84" y2="84" class="redline" />
    <text x="860" y="79" text-anchor="end" class="s r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>GOMEMLIMIT ~85% soft target</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>GOMEMLIMIT ~85% trần mềm</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Left: Go Heap layers */}
    <rect x="36" y="100" width="510" height="240" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="52" y="124" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Go managed heap (HeapSys - HeapReleased in RAM)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Go heap đang nằm trên RAM (HeapSys - HeapReleased)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* HeapInuse */}
    <rect x="52" y="140" width="478" height="122" rx="7" class="goldbox" />
    <text x="68" y="164" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>HeapInuse · /memory/classes/heap/objects + free</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>HeapInuse · các span 8 KiB đang mở</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="68" y="185" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Active 8 KiB runtime spans (gap to HeapAlloc = fragmentation)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Span 8 KiB còn giữ ít nhất 1 object (phần dôi ra là phân mảnh)</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* HeapAlloc */}
    <rect x="68" y="198" width="290" height="52" rx="6" class="live" />
    <text x="82" y="219" class="b">HeapAlloc / heap/objects</text>
    <text x="82" y="240" class="m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Live reachable Go objects</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Byte object Go còn sống thật</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Free/Released row under HeapInuse */}
    <rect x="52" y="274" width="232" height="52" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="64" y="294" class="b">HeapIdle - HeapReleased</text>
    <text x="64" y="315" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Empty spans kept warm in RAM</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Span rỗng giữ tạm trên RAM</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="298" y="274" width="232" height="52" rx="6" class="skip" />
    <text x="310" y="294" class="m">HeapReleased (madvise)</text>
    <text x="310" y="315" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Returned to OS, off RSS</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đã trả OS, không tính vào RSS</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Right: Off-heap segments */}
    <rect x="564" y="100" width="300" height="240" rx="8" class="hot" />
    <text x="580" y="124" class="r">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Invisible to HeapAlloc</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>HeapAlloc không đếm phần này</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="580" y="140" width="268" height="54" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="594" y="161" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Goroutine stacks</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Stack của goroutine</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="594" y="182" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Leaked goroutines grow RSS silently</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Rò goroutine làm RSS phình ngầm</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="580" y="204" width="268" height="54" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="594" y="225" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Cgo allocations &amp; mmap</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Bộ nhớ Cgo &amp; mmap riêng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="594" y="246" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Outside Go GC and runtime/metrics heap</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Nằm ngoài Go GC và bộ đếm heap</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="580" y="268" width="268" height="58" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="594" y="290" class="b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>OS page cache (active files)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>OS page cache (file vừa đọc/ghi)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="594" y="311" class="s">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Counted inside cAdvisor working_set</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Vẫn bị cộng vào working_set của cAdvisor</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>If container working_set climbs near the OOM limit while HeapAlloc stays flat, the leak sits on the right (goroutine stacks, Cgo, mmap, or file cache). Only when HeapInuse dwarfs HeapAlloc is the issue span fragmentation inside the Go heap.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nếu working_set của container tiến sát ngưỡng OOMKill trong khi HeapAlloc đứng yên, phần rò đang nằm bên cột phải (stack goroutine bị kẹt, Cgo, mmap hoặc OS page cache). Chỉ khi HeapInuse vượt xa HeapAlloc thì mới là phân mảnh span trong Go heap.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp17b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp17b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp17b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp17b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp17b .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp17b .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp17b .m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17b .s { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp17b .r { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gp17b .outer { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gp17b .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp17b .goldbox { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp17b .live { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp17b .skip { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp17b .hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp17b .redline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .gp17b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
